  "operative_text": "Section 1 (Md. Code Ann., Criminal Law § 4-301(h)): “CONVERTIBLE PISTOL” MEANS ANY SEMIAUTOMATIC PISTOL THAT CAN BE CONVERTED INTO A MACHINE GUN SOLELY BY THE ATTACHMENT OF A SWITCH/AUTO–SEAR.\nSection 1 (Md. Code Ann., Criminal Law § 4-305.2): A PERSON MAY NOT MANUFACTURE, SELL, OFFER FOR SALE, PURCHASE, RECEIVE, OR TRANSFER A CONVERTIBLE PISTOL."
